  "details": "In the new menu, the display for notifications allows you to select a View Profile button to immediately jump to someone's profile. Selecting this will change to the Social tab and display the user's profile. Returning from the Profile menu will place you back at the Social tab instead of the Notifications tab. \nThis is inconvenient, but it also seems like erroneous behaviour. If the ... button on the notification is clicked, a seperate menu will open where one of the options is to View Profile. Selecting that option will also show the user's profile, but without changing to the Social tab. The visible button should be changed to work like this duplicate.",
